#: ../../classes/autosolver.rst:4
msgid "AutoSolver — Sélecteur automatique d'algorithmes"
msgstr "AutoSolver — Automatic Algorithm Selector"

#: PyAdverseSearch.classes.autosolver:2 of
msgid "Module autosolver"
msgstr "Autosolver module"

#: PyAdverseSearch.classes.autosolver:4 of
msgid ""
"AutoSolver - Selecteur automatique d'algorithmes pour les jeux adversariaux."
msgstr "AutoSolver - Automatic algorithm selector for adversarial games."

#: PyAdverseSearch.classes.autosolver:6 of
msgid "Deux modes disponibles :"
msgstr "Two modes available:"

#: PyAdverseSearch.classes.autosolver:8 of
msgid ""
"``\"classic\"`` : utilise tous les algorithmes disponibles de facon "
"intelligente selon la phase de jeu (debut / milieu / fin)."
msgstr ""
"``\"classic\"``: uses all available algorithms intelligently depending on "
"the phase of play (beginning / middle / end)."

#: PyAdverseSearch.classes.autosolver:10 of
msgid ""
"``\"fast\"`` : utilise uniquement les algorithmes les plus rapides (MTD(f) "
"avec iterative deepening + PN-Search en fin de partie)."
msgstr ""
"``\"fast\"``: only uses the fastest algorithms (MTD(f) with iterative "
"deepening + PN-Search at the end of the game)."

#: PyAdverseSearch.classes.autosolver:13 of
msgid ""
"Chaque appel a ``choose_best_move`` enregistre des statistiques sur "
"l'algorithme utilise, la raison du choix et les performances mesurees."
msgstr ""
"Each call to ``choose_best_move`` records statistics on the algorithm used, "
"the reason for the choice and the performance measured."

#: PyAdverseSearch.classes.autosolver.AlgoRecord:1 of
msgid "Enregistrement des statistiques d'un coup joue par AutoSolver."
msgstr "Recording of one-shot statistics performed by AutoSolver."

#: PyAdverseSearch.classes.autosolver.AutoSolver:1 of
msgid "Selecteur automatique d'algorithmes."
msgstr "Automatic algorithm selector."

#: PyAdverseSearch.classes.autosolver.AutoSolver:4 of
msgid "Parametres"
msgstr "Settings"

#: PyAdverseSearch.classes.autosolver.AutoSolver:5 of
msgid ""
"game : instance du jeu (doit exposer game_is_terminal / game_utility) depth "
": profondeur de recherche souhaitee mode  : \"classic\" (tous les algos) ou "
"\"fast\" (MTDf + PNSearch uniquement) rows  : nombre de lignes du plateau "
"(pour calculer le remplissage) cols  : nombre de colonnes du plateau"
msgstr ""
"game: game instance (must expose game_is_terminal / game_utility) depth: "
"desired search depth mode: \"classic\" (all algorithms) or \"fast\" (MTDf + "
"PNSearch only) rows: number of rows on the board (to calculate filling) "
"cols: number of columns on the board"

#: PyAdverseSearch.classes.autosolver.AutoSolver.choose_best_move:1 of
msgid ""
"Selectionne dynamiquement le meilleur algorithme pour cet etat, appelle "
"choose_best_move sur cet algorithme et enregistre les stats."
msgstr ""
"Dynamically selects the best algorithm for this state, calls "
"choose_best_move on this algorithm and records the stats."

#: PyAdverseSearch.classes.autosolver.AutoSolver.choose_best_move:4 of
msgid "Retourne l'etat fils correspondant au meilleur coup."
msgstr "Returns the child state corresponding to the best move."

#: PyAdverseSearch.classes.autosolver.AutoSolver.get_records:1 of
msgid "Retourne la liste des AlgoRecord enregistres."
msgstr "Returns the list of registered AlgoRecords."

