msgstr "Reason for last choice (or '' if none)."

#: PyAdverseSearch.classes.autosolver.AutoSolver._pick_fast:1 of
msgid "Mode RAPIDE : MTD(f) par defaut, PN-Search si fin de partie proche."
msgstr "FAST mode: MTD(f) by default, PN-Search if end of game is near."

#: PyAdverseSearch.classes.autosolver.AutoSolver._pick_classic:1 of
msgid ""
"Mode CLASSIC : utilise tous les algorithmes de maniere intelligente selon la"
" phase de jeu."
msgstr ""
"CLASSIC mode: uses all algorithms intelligently depending on the phase of "
"play."

#: PyAdverseSearch.classes.autosolver.AutoSolver._pick_classic:4 of
msgid "Repartition par numero de coup :"
msgstr "Distribution by move number:"

#: PyAdverseSearch.classes.autosolver.AutoSolver._pick_classic:5 of
msgid ""
"0       -> Minimax (reference, profondeur limitee) 1-3     -> Alpha-Beta + "
"TT (debut, elagage efficace) 4-5     -> MTD(f) (fenetre nulle, rapide) 6-8"
"     -> Negamax (variante simplifiee) 9-12    -> Alpha-Beta + TT (milieu de "
"partie fiable) 13-15   -> Monte Carlo si arbre large, sinon Alpha-Beta > 15"
"    -> PN-Search si <= 8 cases, Alpha-Beta sinon"
msgstr ""
"0 -> Minimax (reference, limited depth) 1-3 -> Alpha-Beta + TT (start, "
"efficient pruning) 4-5 -> MTD(f) (zero window, fast) 6-8 -> Negamax "
"(simplified variant) 9-12 -> Alpha-Beta + TT (reliable midgame) 13-15 -> "
"Monte Carlo if wide tree, otherwise Alpha-Beta > 15 -> PN-Search if <= 8 "
"boxes, Alpha-Beta otherwise"

#: PyAdverseSearch.classes.autosolver.AutoSolver._invoke:1 of
msgid "Appelle l'algorithme avec sa propre interface."
msgstr "Calls the algorithm with its own interface."

#: PyAdverseSearch.classes.autosolver.AutoSolver._collect_stats:1 of
