"statistical structures (e.g. in MCTS) to reference a node in a stable "
"manner."

#: ../../classes/pnsearch.rst:4
msgid "PNSearch — Proof-Number Search"
msgstr "PNSearch — Proof-Number Search"

#: PyAdverseSearch.classes.pnsearch:1 of
msgid ""
"Implémentation de l'algorithme Proof-Number Search (PN-Search) pour la "
"résolution de fin de partie."
msgstr ""
"Implemented the Proof-Number Search (PN-Search) algorithm for end-game "
"resolution."

#: PyAdverseSearch.classes.pnsearch:3 of
msgid ""
"PN-Search est un algorithme de recherche dans les arbres de jeu qui vise à "
"prouver qu'une position est gagnante ou perdante en utilisant des nombres de"
" preuve (phi) et de réfutation (delta)."
msgstr ""
"PN-Search is a game tree search algorithm that aims to prove that a position"
" is winning or losing using proof (phi) and disconfirmation (delta) numbers."

#: PyAdverseSearch.classes.pnsearch:6 of
msgid ""
"Références : - Allis, L. V. (1994). Searching for Solutions in Games and "
"Artificial Intelligence."
msgstr ""
"References: - Allis, L. V. (1994). Searching for Solutions in Games and "
"Artificial Intelligence."

#: PyAdverseSearch.classes.pnsearch.ProofStatus:1 of
msgid "Statut de preuve d'un nœud PN-Search"
msgstr "Proof status of a PN-Search node"

#: PyAdverseSearch.classes.pnsearch.PNNode:1 of
msgid ""
"Nœud spécialisé pour l'algorithme PN-Search. Stocke les nombres de preuve "
"(phi) et de réfutation (delta)."
msgstr ""
"Specialized node for the PN-Search algorithm. Stores proof (phi) and "
"refutation (delta) numbers."

#: PyAdverseSearch.classes.pnsearch.PNNode.__init__:1 of
msgid "Initialise un nœud PN-Search."
msgstr "Initializes a PN-Search node."

#: PyAdverseSearch.classes.pnsearch.PNNode.__init__:4 of
msgid "État du jeu à ce nœud"
msgstr "Game state at this node"

#: PyAdverseSearch.classes.pnsearch.PNNode.__init__:6 of
