msgstr "Parent node (None for root)"

#: PyAdverseSearch.classes.pnsearch.PNNode.__init__:8 of
msgid "Coup qui a mené à ce nœud depuis le parent"
msgstr "Blow that led to this node from the parent"

#: PyAdverseSearch.classes.pnsearch.PNNode.is_proven:1 of
msgid "Retourne True si la position est prouvée gagnante"
msgstr "Returns True if the position is proven to win"

#: PyAdverseSearch.classes.pnsearch.PNNode.is_disproven:1 of
msgid "Retourne True si la position est prouvée perdante"
msgstr "Returns True if the position is proven to be a loser"

#: PyAdverseSearch.classes.pnsearch.PNNode.is_solved:1 of
msgid "Retourne True si la position est résolue (prouvée ou réfutée)"
msgstr "Returns True if the position is resolved (proven or disproved)"

#: PyAdverseSearch.classes.pnsearch.PNSearch:1 of
msgid "Implémentation de l'algorithme Proof-Number Search."
msgstr "Implementation of the Proof-Number Search algorithm."

#: PyAdverseSearch.classes.pnsearch.PNSearch:3 of
msgid ""
"PN-Search explore l'arbre de jeu de manière sélective en se concentrant sur "
"les branches les plus prometteuses pour prouver ou réfuter une position."
msgstr ""
"PN-Search explores the game tree selectively, focusing on the most promising"
" branches to prove or disprove a position."

#: PyAdverseSearch.classes.pnsearch.PNSearch.__init__:1 of
msgid "Initialise l'algorithme PN-Search."
msgstr "Initializes the PN-Search algorithm."

#: PyAdverseSearch.classes.pnsearch.PNSearch.__init__:4 of
