msgstr "Evaluates a node and initializes its phi and delta values."

#: PyAdverseSearch.classes.pnsearch.PNSearch.evaluate:4 of
msgid "Nœud à évaluer"
msgstr "Node to evaluate"

#: PyAdverseSearch.classes.pnsearch.PNSearch._evaluate_terminal:1 of
