msgstr "Evaluates a leaf node based on utility."

#: PyAdverseSearch.classes.pnsearch.PNSearch._evaluate_terminal:4 of
msgid "Nœud terminal à évaluer"
msgstr "Terminal node to evaluate"

#: PyAdverseSearch.classes.pnsearch.PNSearch.select_most_proving_node:1 of
msgid ""
"Sélectionne le nœud le plus prometteur (Most Proving Node) à développer. "
"Suit le chemin de l'arbre en choisissant à chaque niveau le meilleur enfant."
msgstr ""
"Selects the Most Proving Node to develop. Follow the path of the tree, "
"choosing the best child at each level."

#: PyAdverseSearch.classes.pnsearch.PNSearch._extract_best_partial_move:5
#: PyAdverseSearch.classes.pnsearch.PNSearch.select_most_proving_node:5 of
