msgid "``phi``"
msgstr "``phi``"

#: ../../classes/pnsearch.rst:35
msgid "Nombre de preuves (difficulté de prouver que le noeud est gagnant)"
msgstr "Number of proofs (difficulty of proving that the node is a winner)"

#: ../../classes/pnsearch.rst:36
msgid "``delta``"
msgstr "``delta``"

#: ../../classes/pnsearch.rst:37
msgid "Nombre de réfutations (difficulté de prouver que le noeud est perdant)"
msgstr ""
"Number of refutations (difficulty of proving that the node is a loser)"

#: ../../classes/pnsearch.rst:39
msgid ""
"Pour un noeud OR (joueur MAX) : ``phi = min(enfants.phi)``, ``delta = "
"sum(enfants.delta)``"
msgstr ""
"For an OR node (MAX player): ``phi = min(enfants.phi)``, ``delta = "
"sum(enfants.delta)``"

#: ../../classes/pnsearch.rst:41
msgid ""
"Pour un noeud AND (joueur MIN) : ``phi = sum(enfants.phi)``, ``delta = "
"min(enfants.delta)``"
msgstr ""
"For an AND node (MIN player): ``phi = sum(enfants.phi)``, ``delta = "
"min(enfants.delta)``"

#: ../../classes/pnsearch.rst:43
msgid ""
"La recherche sélectionne toujours le **Most Proving Node (MPN)** : le noeud "
"dont l'exploration réduira le plus le nombre de preuve de la racine."
msgstr ""
"The search always selects the **Most Proving Node (MPN)**: the node whose "
"exploration will most reduce the number of root proofs."

