msgstr "Delegates the call to :meth:`Game.game_is_terminal`."

#: PyAdverseSearch.classes.state.State._utility:1 of
msgid "Retourne la valeur d'utilité de cet état terminal."
msgstr "Returns the utility value of this terminal state."

#: PyAdverseSearch.classes.state.State._utility:3 of
