msgstr "Shows the board (can be overloaded)."

#: ../../classes/state.rst:45
msgid "Exemple d'implémentation"
msgstr "Example implementation"

#: ../../classes/state.rst:67
msgid ""
"L'attribut ``game`` est défini automatiquement par :class:`Game` lors de "
"l'initialisation si ``initial_state`` est fourni."
msgstr ""
"The ``game`` attribute is automatically set to :class:`Game` during "
